      "class": "hero",
      "html": "<section class=\"hero\" id=\"heroSection\">\n  <!-- 배경 영상 3개 순차 전환 -->\n  <video id=\"heroBgVideo\" autoplay=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" src=\"https://assets.mixkit.co/videos/21546/21546-720.mp4\"></video>\n  <!-- 모바일 폴백 이미지 슬라이드 -->\n  <div class=\"hero-slides\" id=\"heroSlides\">\n    <div class=\"hero-slide active\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hero-slide\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hero-slide\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hero-slide\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <!-- 오버레이 -->\n  <div class=\"hero-overlay\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"hero-badge\"><span class=\"dot\"></span> <span data-i18n=\"hero_badge\">숏폼 전문 · 월 정기 대량 편집 파트너</span></div>\n  <h1 data-i18n-html=\"hero_h1\">편집부터 납품까지<br>에이컷이 <span class=\"highlight\">매월</span> 처리합니다</h1>\n  <!-- 숏폼 카운터 롤링 배너 -->\n  <div class=\"shorts-ticker\">\n    <div class=\"shorts-ticker-inner\">\n      <span>✂️ 숏폼</span><span class=\"st-num\" id=\"shortsCounter\">0</span><span>편 납품 완료</span>\n      <span class=\"st-div\">·</span>\n      <span>⚡ 평균 납기</span><span style=\"color:#a78bfa;font-weight:800\">D+1</span>\n      <span class=\"st-div\">·</span>\n      <span>🎯 재계약률</span><span style=\"color:#34d399;font-weight:800\">92%</span>\n      <span class=\"st-div\">·</span>\n      <span>✂️ 숏폼</span><span class=\"st-num\">1,200+</span><span>편 납품 완료</span>\n      <span class=\"st-div\">·</span>\n      <span>⚡ 평균 납기</span><span style=\"color:#a78bfa;font-weight:800\">D+1</span>\n      <span class=\"st-div\">·</span>\n      <span>🎯 재계약률</span><span style=\"color:#34d399;font-weight:800\">92%</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"hero-sub\" style=\"word-break:keep-all\" data-i18n-html=\"hero_sub\">숏폼 · 릴스 · 틱톡 대량 편집 전문<br>원본만 주시면 다음날 납품합니다</p>\n  <p class=\"hero-sub2\" data-i18n=\"hero_sub2\">어떤 상황이신가요?</p>\n  <div class=\"cta-options\" id=\"ctaOptions\">\n    <button class=\"cta-option-btn\" onclick=\"selectOption(this)\">\n      <span class=\"cob-icon\">▶</span><span class=\"cob-text\" data-i18n=\"cta_youtube\">유튜브 채널 편집</span>\n    </button>\n    <button class=\"cta-option-btn\" onclick=\"selectOption(this)\">\n      <span class=\"cob-icon\">📢</span><span class=\"cob-"
    },
